{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>A lion's whelp is Judah</b> — in gematria this is David, and also Solomon, and in gematria this is Nahshon." "<b>A lion's whelp is Judah</b> — rashei teivot, in gematria David." "<b>You went up</b> — three times in the Masorah: מטרף בני עלית, כי עלית משכבי אביך, עלית למרום. To Reuben He said: עלית — and you were worthy to receive the gifts of priesthood and kingship, as it is written of him: ויתן עוז למלכו. And what caused you to lose it? כי עלית משכבי אביך. But to Judah He said: you, of whom it says מטרף בני עלית — you merited and עלית and received the gifts of kingship."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:42.810967732Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}